For plain slurry;

Plastic viscosity = (62.5-41.5)1.5 = (21)1.5 = 31.5

For silica sand;

Plastic viscosity = (96-78)1.5 = (18)1.5 = 27cp

For palm kernel fibre;

Plastic viscosity = (57.5-36.5)1.5 = (21)1.5 = 31.5cp

For Egg shell;

Plastic viscosity = (143-119)1.5 = (24)1.5 = 36cp

For Snail shell;

Plastic viscosity = (164.5-127.5)1.5 = (37)1.5 = 55.5cp

For Periwinkle shell;

Plastic viscosity = (113.6-91.5)1.5 = (22.1)1.5 = 33cp

For Saw dust;

Plastic viscosity = (277.5-124)1.5 = (153.5)1.5 = 230.26cp

